OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,FA 32-year-old man who raped a woman
OL,7,Fwhile she slept in her caravan after
OL,8,Fthe Royal Windsor Horse Show has been
OL,9,Fjailed for more than eight years,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FRyan Dinnage raped the woman after
OL,13,Fentering her caravan in the early
OL,14,Fhours of Monday 16 May 2022 following
OL,15,Fthe final day of the equestrian show,
OL,16,Faccording to Thames Valley Police
OL,17,F(TVP).
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
