OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786022313
OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,FThe defendant, of Caithness Walk in
OL,7,FCroydon, south London, was sentenced
OL,8,Fat Reading Crown Court to eight years
OL,9,Fand six months' imprisonment.
OL,11,FThe Royal Windsor Horse Show 2022
OL,12,Fbegan on Friday 13 May, when the late
OL,13,FQueen Elizabeth II toured the show
OL,14,Fgrounds in a rare public appearance,
OL,15,Fand ended on Sunday 15 May.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
