PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786022313
OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,FThe victim had been working at the
OL,7,Fequestrian show when the offence took
OL,8,Fplace, according to TVP.
OL,10,FIt was reported later on Monday 16 May
OL,11,F2022, and Dinnage was arrested the
OL,12,Ffollowing day.
OL,14,FDuring police interviews, he initially
OL,15,Fdenied having engaged in any sexual
OL,16,Factivity with the victim, but forensic
OL,17,Fevidence linked him to the offence.
OL,19,FDinnage then changed his account of
OL,20,Fthe incident and claimed the sexual
OL,21,Factivity had been consensual.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786022313
OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,FDetectives secured digital evidence
OL,7,Ffrom Dinnage's mobile phone which
OL,8,Fcontradicted his account and placed
OL,9,Fhim in the vicinity of the victim's
OL,10,Fcaravan at the time of the offence,
OL,11,FTVP said.
OL,13,FHe was charged by postal requisition
OL,14,Fon March 6 2025 and later stood trial
OL,15,Fat Reading Crown Court.
OL,17,FOn June 8 of this year, the jury
OL,18,Funanimously found Dinnage guilty of
OL,19,Fone count of rape.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
