OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786022313
OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,FHe was acquitted of one count of
OL,7,Fsexual assault and one count of
OL,8,Fcausing a female to engage in non-
OL,9,Fpenetrative sexual activity.
OL,11,FInvestigating officer Detective
OL,12,FConstable Arshid Ali said: "I am
OL,13,Fpleased with the sentence handed down,
OL,14,Fwhich reflects the seriousness of this
OL,15,Foffence.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786022313
OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,F"Thames Valley Police takes all
OL,7,Freports of sexual offences extremely
OL,8,Fseriously, and we remain committed to
OL,9,Finvestigating these offences
OL,10,Fthoroughly and bringing those
OL,11,Fresponsible to justice.
OL,13,F"This has been a long and difficult
OL,14,Fprocess for the victim, spanning more
OL,15,Fthan four years.
OL,17,F"I hope that the sentence handed down
OL,18,Fprovides her with a sense of closure
OL,19,Fand allows her to begin moving forward
OL,20,Fwith her life.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
