PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786022313
OL,3,CMan who raped woman in caravan after
OL,4,CRoyal Windsor Horse Show jailed
OL,6,F"I would like to thank her for the
OL,7,Fcourage and strength she has shown
OL,8,Fthroughout the investigation and court
OL,9,Fproceedings."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
